{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北角發生嚴重車禍。今晚（4日）約10時13分，警方接報指，一輛中型貨車在英皇道與書局街交界，撞到一名女子。</p><p>救援人員趕至，發現被撞女子已陷昏迷，立即將她送往東區醫院搶救。警方正調查意外原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷送往東區醫院搶救。（資料圖片/黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250829/1038084603644219392620513.jpeg/so2mo55rLqImNo8pYDuDrz3__2vo2L6sawiu6kEIruo\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷送往東區醫院搶救。（資料圖片/黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.229912+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:46:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:38.251717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:38.251717+00:00","content_hash":"9512532f66f96f9aea2b4ba6370f0c46932ca102eb274f3a73e3dbc489cd1b07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}